# First Horde kodo from Harb Clawhoof (Bloodhoof Village).
# Sources: Forever client 1.60.1.70338 tables via wago.tools (ItemSparse: level,
# price, races, riding spell; SkillLineAbility: Riding); npcs.json and
# items.json for the trainer, the vendor and its stock.
# Forever riding: one Riding skill (Apprentice 75 from level 40, Journeyman 150
# at 60). Training costs 100g and 1,000g (Forever's world data: the trainers of
# Velma Warnam and Genn Fairweather, build 70124) and comes with a mount
# (Blizzard). ItemSparse lists the mounts at 20g (level 40) and 200g (level 60)
# for every race of the faction, but each one also needs Kodo Riding (18995;
# MountCapability), which SkillLineAbility gives only Tauren with Riding: the
# faction's other races and the Skyborne must learn it.
# ASSUMED: Kar Stormsinger teaches it to them at Exalted with Thunder Bluff (Classic
# rule; a beta player guide says other races' mounts need Exalted). In-game
# check: a Orc at Kar Stormsinger, with and without Exalted.
# ASSUMED: Honored with your race's home city takes 10% off training and mounts
# (beta player guides; Classic had the same). In-game check: the price at Honored.
# ASSUMED: Harb Clawhoof sells White Kodo too (a beta player guide lists it at this
# vendor, and the same NPC sells it in today's game; our data has no vendor row).
# In-game check: Harb Clawhoof's list.

step Learn to ride
  zone Mulgore
  tip Kar Stormsinger and Harb Clawhoof's kodos are in Bloodhoof Village, Mulgore. At 40 Kar Stormsinger teaches Riding to Tauren for 100g (10% less at Honored with Thunder Bluff), and it comes with a kodo. Other races learn Riding, with their own first mount, at their own race's riding trainer.
  level 40
  train 3690 only Tauren              -- Kar Stormsinger, riding trainer
  skill Riding 75

step Kodo Riding for other races
  only Orc,Troll,Undead,Skyborne
  when !knows 18995
  tip Any Horde race can buy these kodos, but riding one also takes Kodo Riding, which only Tauren get with Riding. Kar Stormsinger teaches it to other races once they are Exalted with Thunder Bluff (the Thunder Bluff Reputation guide shows the way). Until then, don't buy a kodo for this character.
  rep "Thunder Bluff" Exalted
  train 3690                          -- Kar Stormsinger, Kodo Riding

step Pick a colour
  tip Harb Clawhoof sells the other colours (20g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like.
  vendor 3685                         -- Harb Clawhoof
  buy 15277 npc 3685 optional         -- Gray Kodo, 20g
  buy 15290 npc 3685 optional         -- Brown Kodo, 20g
  buy 275993 "White Kodo" npc 3685 optional -- new in Forever, 20g; beta players found it here
  note Lavender Kodo is a new Forever kodo (level 40, 20g in the client) whose source is not known yet.
